# Scoped to packages/zorya/Dockerfile (BuildKit convention).
#
# bun.lock references every workspace in the monorepo, so --frozen-lockfile
# fails if any are missing. We include all packages (their package.json at
# minimum) but strip heavy build artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.nx
**/.target
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.githooks
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

docs
.beads
.claude
benchmarks

documentation/generator/.next
documentation/generator/node_modules

*.log
.env
.env.*
